# Cloudflare Pages response headers (copied into build/web by flutter build).
# No full Content-Security-Policy: Flutter's WebAssembly build, the bundled
# fonts and the listing photos' CDNs would each need an exception; only
# framing is refused. Cross-origin isolated (N.85): Flutter's skwasm renderer
# then draws on its own thread, so the page's main thread is free sooner.
# `credentialless`, not `require-corp`: the listing photos' CDN sends no
# Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy header, and credentialless still lets an
# <img> load them (without cookies, which they don't need). Browsers that
# don't know credentialless (Safari) just stay single-threaded as before.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
